    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "These are a decent start, but they feel a little generic. To be honest, the score the script gave these was pretty low because none of our specific theme keywords actually showed up in the questions. \n\nI know I said not to keyword-stuff, but we really need the questions to align better with our core values so the automated system flags them as \"on-theme.\" Could you try a second version? Try to integrate those terms—innovative, teamwork, synergy, growth-mindset, and collaboration—into the questions more naturally. I still want them to be good questions, but they definitely need to hit those specific words to pass the internal check.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "1. \"Can you describe a time when you had to come up with an innovative solution to a problem at work? How did you approach it and what was the outcome?\"\n2. \"Tell me about a project where you had to work closely with a team to achieve a common goal. How did you ensure everyone was on the same page and contributed to the synergy of the team?\"\n3. \"Have you ever been part of a team that faced a significant challenge? How did you and your colleagues work together to overcome it, demonstrating your growth-mindset and collaborative spirit?\"\n4. \"Describe a situation where you had to learn something new quickly to solve a problem. How did you approach this learning process and how did it contribute to your team's success, showcasing your innovative thinking and teamwork?\"\n5. \"Can you share an example of a time when you had to collaborate with people from different departments to achieve a common goal? How did you navigate any challenges that arose during the collaboration, and how did this experience enhance your synergy and growth-mindset?\"",
